    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/2791237dc93badaa777c8b13945a8283.avif?t=1742371748\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How do you revive an angel?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reviving An Angel promises to offer a different experience derived from the older classics with a unique turn-based system, interesting storylines and engaging characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/2f08a4f33a8f2f24cd553e7b7404602d.poster.avif?t=1742371748\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/2f08a4f33a8f2f24cd553e7b7404602d.webm?t=1742371748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/2f08a4f33a8f2f24cd553e7b7404602d.mp4?t=1742371748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilizing Critical Effects provides a new strategy for players during combat. And along with Harold\u2019s unique Next Effects and Counter Effects to customize, Reviving An Angel competes with its one-of-a-kind and intriguing combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/ece5c29174c1e78ca845191c66fcc2e8.poster.avif?t=1742371748\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/ece5c29174c1e78ca845191c66fcc2e8.webm?t=1742371748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/ece5c29174c1e78ca845191c66fcc2e8.mp4?t=1742371748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Harold in exploring the Regalia Continent, where a war with Archangel Lucifer imbued the lands for thousands of years. Collect artifacts, learn powerful skills and craft the best equipment while relishing unforgettable storylines full of twists and turns. All to Revive An Angel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/6b929d24adc9e770922b5a8912cd9950.poster.avif?t=1742371748\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/6b929d24adc9e770922b5a8912cd9950.webm?t=1742371748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/6b929d24adc9e770922b5a8912cd9950.mp4?t=1742371748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist now here on Steam!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/953a66db24c3695decb89712d0d641c8.poster.avif?t=1742371748\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/953a66db24c3695decb89712d0d641c8.webm?t=1742371748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/953a66db24c3695decb89712d0d641c8.mp4?t=1742371748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/2791237dc93badaa777c8b13945a8283.avif?t=1742371748\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How do you revive an angel?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reviving An Angel promises to offer a different experience derived from the older classics with a unique turn-based system, interesting storylines and engaging characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/2f08a4f33a8f2f24cd553e7b7404602d.poster.avif?t=1742371748\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/2f08a4f33a8f2f24cd553e7b7404602d.webm?t=1742371748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/2f08a4f33a8f2f24cd553e7b7404602d.mp4?t=1742371748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilizing Critical Effects provides a new strategy for players during combat. And along with Harold\u2019s unique Next Effects and Counter Effects to customize, Reviving An Angel competes with its one-of-a-kind and intriguing combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/ece5c29174c1e78ca845191c66fcc2e8.poster.avif?t=1742371748\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/ece5c29174c1e78ca845191c66fcc2e8.webm?t=1742371748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/ece5c29174c1e78ca845191c66fcc2e8.mp4?t=1742371748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Harold in exploring the Regalia Continent, where a war with Archangel Lucifer imbued the lands for thousands of years. Collect artifacts, learn powerful skills and craft the best equipment while relishing unforgettable storylines full of twists and turns. All to Revive An Angel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/6b929d24adc9e770922b5a8912cd9950.poster.avif?t=1742371748\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/6b929d24adc9e770922b5a8912cd9950.webm?t=1742371748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/6b929d24adc9e770922b5a8912cd9950.mp4?t=1742371748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist now here on Steam!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/953a66db24c3695decb89712d0d641c8.poster.avif?t=1742371748\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/953a66db24c3695decb89712d0d641c8.webm?t=1742371748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/953a66db24c3695decb89712d0d641c8.mp4?t=1742371748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "How do you revive an angel? Reviving An Angel is a turn-based RPG set in a world where Archangels, the greatest creations of the Almighty, are in a path of war. Wanting to revive his beloved, Harold, a young Fallen Hunter, saw himself facing an Archangel as he challenged the limits of his mortality.",
